{"id":"c5b3799b1501dcab","group":"72","path":"72/72-thm-dependent-function-quotient-action.md","title":"依赖函数 PER 元素在商类上的作用","display":"thm-dependent-function-quotient-action — 依赖函数 PER 元素在商类上的作用","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-thm-dependent-function-quotient-action","aliases":["72-thm-dependent-function-quotient-action"],"display":"thm-dependent-function-quotient-action — 依赖函数 PER 元素在商类上的作用","depends_on":["[[72-df-dependent-function-per]]","[[72-thm-dependent-function-per]]","[[72-df-partial-equivalence-relation]]"],"chapter":"X","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.X §3.9 dependent function PER, print746/PDF758; local quotient interpretation","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"source-statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked","proof_status":"local argument checked; not machine checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"created":"2026-10-22","revision_round":"2026-10-22-expansion"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-thm-dependent-function-quotient-action"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-thm-dependent-function-quotient-action</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-dependent-function-quotient-action — 依赖函数 PER 元素在商类上的作用"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b6318833c3cb4f67\" href=\"?note=b6318833c3cb4f67\" title=\"72-df-dependent-function-per\">72-df-dependent-function-per</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c122cb00ad69a4f6\" href=\"?note=c122cb00ad69a4f6\" title=\"72-thm-dependent-function-per\">72-thm-dependent-function-per</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"855f0d0656844c14\" href=\"?note=855f0d0656844c14\" title=\"72-df-partial-equivalence-relation\">72-df-partial-equivalence-relation</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"X"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.X §3.9 dependent function PER, print746/PDF758; local quotient interpretation"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"local argument checked; not machine checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-22"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"2026-10-22-expansion"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P:=\\Pi_{\\mathfrak e,\\mathsf{Lam},\\operatorname{app}}(\\alpha,\\Phi)\">\\(P:=\\Pi_{\\mathfrak e,\\mathsf{Lam},\\operatorname{app}}(\\alpha,\\Phi)\\)</span> 及其结构与不变纤维取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b6318833c3cb4f67\" href=\"?note=b6318833c3cb4f67\" title=\"72-df-dependent-function-per\">72-df-dependent-function-per</a>，其 PER 性取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"c122cb00ad69a4f6\" href=\"?note=c122cb00ad69a4f6\" title=\"72-thm-dependent-function-per\">72-thm-dependent-function-per</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\\in|P|\">\\(r\\in|P|\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q:=|\\alpha|/\\alpha\">\\(Q:=|\\alpha|/\\alpha\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\overline\\Phi:=\\{\\langle[a]_\\alpha,|\\Phi(a)|/\\Phi(a)\\rangle:a\\in|\\alpha|\\}\">\\(\\overline\\Phi:=\\{\\langle[a]_\\alpha,|\\Phi(a)|/\\Phi(a)\\rangle:a\\in|\\alpha|\\}\\)</span>。对满足 r↓v 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v\\in\\mathsf{Lam}\">\\(v\\in\\mathsf{Lam}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g_v\">\\(g_v\\)</span> 在下式构造。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"g_v:=\\{\\langle[a]_\\alpha,[\\operatorname{app}(v,a)]_{\\Phi(a)}\\rangle:a\\in|\\alpha|\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[g_v:=\\{\\langle[a]_\\alpha,[\\operatorname{app}(v,a)]_{\\Phi(a)}\\rangle:a\\in|\\alpha|\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists v\\in\\mathsf{Lam}\\ \\bigl[r\\Downarrow v\\land g_v:Q\\to\\bigcup\\operatorname{ran}(\\overline\\Phi)\n\\land\\forall q\\in Q\\ (g_v(q)\\in\\overline\\Phi(q))\\bigr].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists v\\in\\mathsf{Lam}\\ \\bigl[r\\Downarrow v\\land g_v:Q\\to\\bigcup\\operatorname{ran}(\\overline\\Phi)\n\\land\\forall q\\in Q\\ (g_v(q)\\in\\overline\\Phi(q))\\bigr].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>rPr 的预求值见证由确定性给同一规范 λ 值 v，并保证 v 的所有 α 相等输入产生 Φ(a) 相等输出；取相同输入也保证输出在该纤维支撑内。纤维在 α 类上不变，故商类函数良定义，且 v 由求值唯一。没有断言每个集合论商类函数都可由某个闭 λ 项实现；这需要另一个表示性定理。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-dependent-function-per","status":"resolved","id":"b6318833c3cb4f67","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-dependent-function-per]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-thm-dependent-function-per","status":"resolved","id":"c122cb00ad69a4f6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-thm-dependent-function-per]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-partial-equivalence-relation","status":"resolved","id":"855f0d0656844c14","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-partial-equivalence-relation]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-dependent-function-per","status":"resolved","id":"b6318833c3cb4f67","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$P:=\\Pi_{\\mathfrak e,\\mathsf{Lam},\\operatorname{app}}(\\alpha,\\Phi)$ 及其结构与不变纤维取 [[72-df-dependent-function-per]]，其 PER 性取 [[72-thm-dependent-function-per]]。","embed":false},{"target":"72-thm-dependent-function-per","status":"resolved","id":"c122cb00ad69a4f6","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$P:=\\Pi_{\\mathfrak e,\\mathsf{Lam},\\operatorname{app}}(\\alpha,\\Phi)$ 及其结构与不变纤维取 [[72-df-dependent-function-per]]，其 PER 性取 [[72-thm-dependent-function-per]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"P:=\\Pi_{\\mathfrak e,\\mathsf{Lam},\\operatorname{app}}(\\alpha,\\Phi)","display":false},{"tex":"r\\in|P|","display":false},{"tex":"Q:=|\\alpha|/\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"\\overline\\Phi:=\\{\\langle[a]_\\alpha,|\\Phi(a)|/\\Phi(a)\\rangle:a\\in|\\alpha|\\}","display":false},{"tex":"v\\in\\mathsf{Lam}","display":false},{"tex":"g_v","display":false},{"tex":"g_v:=\\{\\langle[a]_\\alpha,[\\operatorname{app}(v,a)]_{\\Phi(a)}\\rangle:a\\in|\\alpha|\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\exists v\\in\\mathsf{Lam}\\ \\bigl[r\\Downarrow v\\land g_v:Q\\to\\bigcup\\operatorname{ran}(\\overline\\Phi)\n\\land\\forall q\\in Q\\ (g_v(q)\\in\\overline\\Phi(q))\\bigr].","display":true}],"bytes":1994,"backlinks":[{"id":"e6c99e2646691c7d","anchor":"ref-203","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"X章新增8项：[[72-df-dependent-pair-membership-per]] · [[72-df-disjoint-sum-membership-per]] · [[72-df-natural-number-membership-per]] · [[72-ex-function-per-domain-antitonicity]] · [[72-thm-dependent-function-quotient-action]] · [[72-thm-dependent-pair-per]] · [[72-thm-natural-number-per-quotient]] · [[72-thm-product-per-quotient]]"},{"id":"6aa9c9e25ba49583","anchor":"ref-200","locations":["正文"],"coun